        },
        {
          "text": "Na ndaamba kuti, Nsikooyeeya limbi makani aakwe, nsikooyooamba limbi muzina lyakwe, ndajana kuti mumoyo wangu muli anga mulilo uuyakisya uujalilidwe mukati kazifuwa zyangu, mane lumwi candikataazya kundikasya, amoyo wangu waata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
