        },
        {
          "text": "Pele Jehova uli ambe, ngusinguzu uuyoosya. Nkaambo kako basikundipenzya bayoolebwa, tabakooyoozunda pe. Bayoousa insoni loko, nkaambo kakuti tabakooyookonzya kucita mbubakanza. Bweeme bwabo tabukooyoomana, tabukooyoolubwa pe. ",
          "type": "text",
